I18n.add({fr:{"Tower Move":"La tour","🗼 Tower Move":"🗼 La tour","Choose how many rings":"Choisis combien d'anneaux","🏅 Best possible:":"🏅 Le mieux possible :","Move the whole tower to the ⭐ pole!":"Déplace toute la tour sur le bâton ⭐ !","Tap a pole to pick up its top ring, then tap another pole to drop it. A big ring can never go on a smaller one. Keys 1 2 3 work too.":"Touche un bâton pour prendre l'anneau du dessus, puis un autre bâton pour le poser. Un grand anneau ne va jamais sur un plus petit. Les touches 1 2 3 marchent aussi.","Pole {n}, {rings} rings":"Bâton {n}, {rings} anneaux","Pole {n} (goal), {rings} rings":"Bâton {n} (arrivée), {rings} anneaux","That pole is empty. Pick one with rings!":"Ce bâton est vide. Prends-en un avec des anneaux !","Now tap where it should go.":"Maintenant, touche où il doit aller.","Put it back. Pick a ring!":"Reposé. Choisis un anneau !","Too big! A big ring can't sit on a small one.":"Trop grand ! Un grand anneau ne va pas sur un petit.","🏆 Perfect! Done in {n} moves! 🏆":"🏆 Parfait ! Fini en {n} coups ! 🏆","🎉 You did it in {n} moves! 🎉":"🎉 Réussi en {n} coups ! 🎉"},"zh-HK":{"Tower Move":"搬塔","🗼 Tower Move":"🗼 搬塔","Choose how many rings":"揀幾多個圈","🏅 Best possible:":"🏅 最少步數：","Move the whole tower to the ⭐ pole!":"將成座塔搬去 ⭐ 嗰支柱！","Tap a pole to pick up its top ring, then tap another pole to drop it. A big ring can never go on a smaller one. Keys 1 2 3 work too.":"撳一支柱拎起最頂嗰個圈，再撳另一支柱放低佢。大圈永遠唔可以放喺細圈上面。撳 1 2 3 都得。","Pole {n}, {rings} rings":"第 {n} 支柱，{rings} 個圈","Pole {n} (goal), {rings} rings":"第 {n} 支柱（終點），{rings} 個圈","That pole is empty. Pick one with rings!":"嗰支柱冇圈。揀支有圈嘅啦！","Now tap where it should go.":"而家撳你想放去邊。","Put it back. Pick a ring!":"放返低咗。揀個圈啦！","Too big! A big ring can't sit on a small one.":"太大喇！大圈唔可以放喺細圈上面。","🏆 Perfect! Done in {n} moves! 🏆":"🏆 完美！{n} 步就搞掂！🏆","🎉 You did it in {n} moves! 🎉":"🎉 你用咗 {n} 步完成！🎉"}});